    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Prof, Anil Jayantha Fernando, Minister of Labour do by virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended by Act, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes-Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mr. Wasantha Wickramaratne punchhewa No. 10/51, Wewelwala Road, Kithulampitiya, Galla. to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration.",
